			x: 2.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4F90C8C104390038"]
			description: ["Within the obelisks, you find technology capable of creating beams of plasma so hot, they deprecate into a degenerate form of matter in-between light and matter. Safe to say, these aliens had their &o&8stuff&r figured out. Only certain materials work. Researching this block inside of a scanner will grant you it's secrets."]
